title: HWg-STE2: Sensors without Unit
agents: snmp
catalog: hw/environment/hwg
license: GPLv2
distribution: check_mk
description:
 This check monitors accessory sensors of the STE2 Ethernet thermometer
 for which the device reports no unit, for example TVOC or air pressure
 sensors. The value is shown as reported by the device, without a unit.

 The service state follows the status that the device reports for the
 sensor: OK if it is normal, CRIT if the value is out of range or in
 alarm, and UNKNOWN if the sensor is invalid. You can also configure upper
 and lower levels. The service is UNKNOWN if the value cannot be read.

item:
 The index of the sensor

discovery:
 One service is created for each valid sensor without unit.
